Unmodified. Point-in-time S&P 500 membership snapshots, 1996-01-02 to
2026-04-17 (2,709 rows). Verified survivorship-free: 1,199 distinct tickers
ever appear, 503 in the final snapshot; Lehman (LEHMQ), Enron (ENRNQ),
WorldCom (WCOEQ), SVB (SIVB), First Republic (FRC) all present with
day-accurate exit dates.

CAVEAT: entities are keyed by their TERMINAL ticker, not the as-traded
symbol (Lehman appears as LEHMQ across its entire 1998-2008 index life, not
LEH). A raw-symbol join silently drops renamed entities. Post-2018 snapshot
resolution degrades to a 121-day maximum gap.
